#: ../frontend/collaborate/components/SessionExpiredModal.tsx:88
msgid ""
"This collaborative session has ended due to inactivity. As the owner, you "
"can save it to the gallery or download it as a PNG."
msgstr ""
"由于无活动，此协作会话已结束。作为所有者，您可以将其保存到画廊或下载为 PNG。"

#: ../frontend/collaborate/components/SessionExpiredModal.tsx:87
msgid ""
"This collaborative session has ended due to inactivity. The session has "
"already been saved to the gallery, but you can download it as a PNG."
msgstr ""
"由于无活动，此协作会话已结束。会话已保存到画廊，但您可以将其下载为 PNG。"

#: ../frontend/collaborate/components/SessionExpiredModal.tsx:89
msgid ""
"This collaborative session has ended due to inactivity. You can save your "
"work locally as a PNG before leaving."
msgstr "由于无活动，此协作会话已结束。您可以在离开前将您的作品保存为 PNG。"

#: ../frontend/collaborate/components/SessionExpiredModal.tsx:45
msgid "This session has already been saved. You can only download it as a PNG."
msgstr "此会话已保存。您只能将其下载为 PNG。"

#: ../frontend/collaborate/components/modals/RoomFullModal.tsx:25
msgid ""
"This session is full ({currentUserCount}/{maxUsers} users). Only the first "
"{maxUsers} users can join a session."
msgstr ""
"此会话已满（{currentUserCount}/{maxUsers} 位用户）。只有前 {maxUsers} 位用户"
"可以加入会话。"

